# Alt+Shift+Left and Alt+Shift+Right extend the selection by word, so typing replaces the selected words; Alt+Left and Alt+Right move by word.
file <<END
- Buy fresh milk today
END
see Buy fresh milk today
keys <Enter> <A-S-Left> <A-S-Left>
type bread
keys <Home> <A-S-Right>
type Get
keys <A-Right> <A-Left>
type very
keys <Space>
keys <Esc>
see - Get very fresh bread
quit
saved <<END
- Get very fresh bread
END
